SUMMARY:Deadline: Erase Indifference Challenge 2026 (Auschwitz Pledge Found
 ation\; EUR 90\,000 in awards for projects countering hate)
DESCRIPTION:The annual Erase Indifference Challenge rewards existing projec
 ts that move bystanders to act against discrimination and hate\, through a
 rt\, education or technology. The project must already exist with demonstr
 ated impact\; completed projects must have ended no earlier than December 
 2023 and the organisation must still be operating.\n\nOrganisation: Auschw
 itz Pledge Foundation\nLocation: Worldwide. Remote application.\nAward: EU
 R 90\,000 in total: one EUR 20\,000 Main Award plus seven EUR 10\,000 awar
 ds. Unrestricted\, no reporting requirement. No application fee.\nDuration
 : Award for an existing project\; finalists meet the jury 15 to 26 Februar
 y 2027\, winners announced 28 February 2027\n\nMore: https://www.eraseindi
 fference.org/challenge/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=r
 eferral
URL:https://www.eraseindifference.org/challenge/?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Worldwide. Remote application.
END:VEVENT
