SUMMARY:Deadline: EMAF 2027: Call for Entries\, Film / Installation / Expan
 ded
DESCRIPTION:The European Media Art Festival (EMAF) in Osnabrueck invites su
 bmissions for its 2027 edition in three sections: Film (experimental films
  of all lengths and any theme)\, Installation (installative\, interactive\
 , spatial or sculptural media art works) and Expanded (performances\, live
  events or workshops).\n\nOrganisation: European Media Art Festival (EMAF)
 \nLocation: Osnabrueck\, Germany. Open worldwide\; selected artists are in
 vited to the festival with free accreditation\, three hotel nights and a c
 ontribution to travel costs.\nAward: All films in the International Select
 ion are equal winners of the EMAF Award and receive EUR 400 each. Screenin
 g fees: EUR 250 for Features\, EUR 80-250 for curated programmes depending
  on length\, EUR 500 for installations and expanded projects\; production 
 costs for installations and expanded projects are paid by the festival. Se
 lected artists get free accreditation\, three hotel nights (longer if setu
 p requires) and a travel cost contribution. No entry fee.\nDuration: Festi
 val in Osnabrueck\, spring 2027\; screening prints must arrive by 1 April 
 2027\n\nMore: https://emaf.filmchief.com/entry-forms?utm_source=artificial
 nouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://emaf.filmchief.com/entry-forms?utm_source=artificialnouveaugran
 tdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Osnabrueck\, Germany. Open worldwide\; selected artists are invite
 d to the festival with free accreditation\, three hotel nights and a contr
 ibution to travel costs.
END:VEVENT
