 utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Wellington\, New Zealand\; open to designers worldwide. Finished g
 arments must be shipped to New Zealand (regional drop-off windows mid-Marc
 h to mid-May 2027).
END:VEVENT
