SUMMARY:Deadline: iF DESIGN STUDENT AWARD 2027 (EUR 50\,000 prize pool\, UN
  SDG design concepts)
DESCRIPTION:An international design competition for students and graduates 
 of up to two years\, for concepts that address one of the UN Sustainable D
 evelopment Goals. Product\, communication\, digital and interaction design
  concepts are all eligible. Free to enter. The official page blocks automa
 ted checks\; details confirmed via secondary listings\, so verify before a
 pplying. Deadline 3 February 2027.\n\nOrganisation: iF International Forum
  Design\nLocation: Online. Open worldwide to students and recent graduates
 .\nAward: EUR 50\,000 prize pool shared among the top-ranked entries (figu
 re from secondary listings\; confirm on the official site). Free to enter.
 \nDuration: One-off competition.\n\nMore: https://ifdesign.com/en/if-desig
 n-student-award?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
